Third-party notice

This pack contains no files from Create. All models and textures in this
repository were created independently for this project. The pack overrides
two model resource locations defined by Create
(create:block/track_signal/white_tube and create:block/track_signal/white_glow)
so that Create renders them with this pack's own model and texture.

Create is (c) The Create Team / The Creators of Create
(https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create). Create's code is licensed
under the MIT License and its assets are All Rights Reserved. This is an
unofficial add-on and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Create team.
